Confirmed FIXED by Seifer (do not re-fix unless something regressed)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
[x] End timestamps exclusive end (HOUR end on the hour dropped last point)
    -> core/Query.py buildTimestamps: while current <= end
[x] BOP/EOP Options radios not wired to Config.periodOffset
    -> Utils.resolvePeriodOffset + Options save writes both hourTimestampMethod
       and periodOffset (EOP=True, BOP=False)
[x] Header sort / Undo smashed Overlay formatting
    -> sort captures UserRole + colors; restore after sort (no rebuild wipe)
[x] QAQC vs Overlay fight club
    -> overlay merges first, then QAQC on final display, then overlay color
       overrides only for mismatch/missing (delta==0 keeps QAQC)
[x] Password paste while masked = chaos
    -> customPasswordEdit now uses Qt native EchoMode.Password / Normal
       (no more dual realText + fake bullets). Brief "show last typed char" is GONE.
[x] Export complete message
    -> success QMessageBox after CSV write


